{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental, not idle! (despite the name)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>short</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> Plinko-style <strong>INCREMENTAL game</strong> where you shoot gumballs at gears and buy upgrades to make bigger and bigger numbers until you break the game! Enjoy the explosive sense of achievement!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gumball Fun:\u00a0</strong>shoot gumballs at gears and enjoy your time by watching them bounce and spin around! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/e371cb5fb417e0904c11ac66934f50ce.poster.avif?t=1773925139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/e371cb5fb417e0904c11ac66934f50ce.webm?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/e371cb5fb417e0904c11ac66934f50ce.mp4?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Upgrades: </strong>buy upgrades to achieve explosive number growth in unique and surprising ways!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/d733d930778d8995f717a6c18dde5971.poster.avif?t=1773925139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/d733d930778d8995f717a6c18dde5971.webm?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/d733d930778d8995f717a6c18dde5971.mp4?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascension: </strong>includes an <i>ascension</i> mechanic that allows you to sacrifice everything to get super powerful upgrades!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/001790861cb3e7ad7ab540d389291aa2.poster.avif?t=1773925139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/001790861cb3e7ad7ab540d389291aa2.webm?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/001790861cb3e7ad7ab540d389291aa2.mp4?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing In-Game Atmosphere: </strong>Features relaxing music and satisfying sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/3c0eb248b9547dd8b77a0db4f6b74a4a.poster.avif?t=1773925139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/3c0eb248b9547dd8b77a0db4f6b74a4a.webm?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/3c0eb248b9547dd8b77a0db4f6b74a4a.mp4?t=1773925139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and/or buy the game! <i>(please)</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724490?t=1773925139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.stea